Segmentation model
------------------
The UNet architecture in src/rhizotrace/segmentation/unet.py comes from the
PlantRootSeg project, https://github.com/GatorSense/PlantRootSeg,
Copyright (c) 2019 Weihuang Xu and Alina Zare, originally released under the GNU
Affero General Public License v3.0. The copyright holders have granted permission to
distribute this adaptation with rhizotrace under its license.

The P-EnDe model weights are not distributed with rhizotrace. Users download them from
the PlantRootSeg repository, under that project's license.

If you use the segmentation model, cite:

Xu, W., Yu, G., Zare, A., Zurweller, B., Rowland, D. L., Reyes-Cabrera, J.,
Fritschi, F. B., Matamala, R., & Juenger, T. E. (2020). Overcoming small
minirhizotron datasets using transfer learning. Computers and Electronics in
